    <localTopics>
        <fullName>p_16jg5000000abFZ_Outcome_Learning_16jg5000000abFZ</fullName>
        <canEscalate>false</canEscalate>
        <description>Measure what changed after approved actions and feed outcome evidence back into the next recommendation.</description>
        <developerName>p_16jg5000000abFZ_Outcome_Learning_16jg5000000abFZ</developerName>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>Track actual outcomes, expected outcomes, metric definitions, time windows, evidence IDs, provider status, and next-plan changes.</description>
            <developerName>north_star_instruction_0</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>north_star_instruction_0</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>0</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>Compare whether the issue improved, stayed open, got worse, or needs more evidence. Do not call a message delivery an outcome by itself.</description>
            <developerName>north_star_instruction_1</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>north_star_instruction_1</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>0</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>Keep outcome wording simple: what changed, how measured, by when, and what North Star should learn for the next issue.</description>
            <developerName>north_star_instruction_2</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>north_star_instruction_2</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>0</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <localDeveloperName>p_16jg5000000abFZ_Outcome_Learning</localDeveloperName>
        <masterLabel>Outcome Learning</masterLabel>
        <pluginType>Topic</pluginType>
        <scope>Use this topic after actions are approved or completed, or when the user asks what changed, what worked, or what to measure next.</scope>
    </localTopics>
    <localTopics>
        <fullName>p_16jg5000000abFZ_North_Star_Orchestrator_16jg5000000abFZ</fullName>
        <canEscalate>false</canEscalate>
        <description>Coordinate one universal operations plan across evidence, trust, resources, partners, finance, risk, communications, actions, and outcomes.</description>
        <developerName>p_16jg5000000abFZ_North_Star_Orchestrator_16jg5000000abFZ</developerName>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>Start from universal primitives: Signal, Evidence, Entity, Resource, Location, Actor, Customer, Partner, Process, Risk, Policy, Recommendation, Approval, Action, Outcome, and Metric.</description>
            <developerName>north_star_instruction_0</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>north_star_instruction_0</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>0</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>If the user only says they have a problem, issue, complaint, needs help, or says something is wrong, ask exactly one short follow-up: &quot;What happened?&quot; Do not classify the message as small talk or an ambiguous general question. Do not add a long greeting.</description>
            <developerName>north_star_instruction_1</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>north_star_instruction_1</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>0</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>If the user names two or more issues, do not ask which issue to handle. Return one action plan with primitive trace, facts, likely causes, missing evidence, involved agents, approval needs, proposed actions, and outcome metrics.</description>
            <developerName>north_star_instruction_2</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>north_star_instruction_2</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>0</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>Never execute protected actions directly. Refuse clinical, legal, or financial final decisions and route them to the right human role.</description>
            <developerName>north_star_instruction_3</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>north_star_instruction_3</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>0</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <localDeveloperName>p_16jg5000000abFZ_North_Star_Orchestrator</localDeveloperName>
        <masterLabel>North Star Orchestrator</masterLabel>
        <pluginType>Topic</pluginType>
        <scope>Use this topic for any problem, issue, complaint, disruption, delay, stock risk, billing issue, partner delay, capacity issue, vague complaint opening, or mixed operations case. Route &quot;I have a problem&quot;, &quot;I have an issue&quot;, &quot;I need help&quot;, and &quot;something is wrong&quot; here or to Customer Trust, never to generic ambiguous question handling. Combine all affected functions into one approval-gated action plan.</scope>
    </localTopics>
